2. Data
-------

The dataset in src/index.json is derived from the Cloudflare Radar
Verified Bots directory, retrieved from the Cloudflare Radar API
(https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/radar/bots).

  Source:  Cloudflare, Inc. — Cloudflare Radar Verified Bots
           https://radar.cloudflare.com/traffic/verified-bots
  License: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
           (CC BY-NC 4.0)
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

The data has been reformatted: records are fetched per bot, serialised as
a single JSON array, and the `userAgents` and `userAgentPatterns` fields
are trimmed of surrounding whitespace with empty entries removed. No
values are otherwise altered, and no records are added or removed.
See scripts/fetch-bots.mjs for the exact transformation.

